--- !u!114 &668972716
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 668972711}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d1fd8fcbf14f4e2428bb1da066f523e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Interactable
  interactionText: 'to talk to Adrian '
  interactionMessage:
  - "I keep on trying to tell my sous chef, Kevin, what to do but he just doesn\u2019t listen to me. He always wants to do things his way instead of just doing what I tell him. There are orders to fill and food to make, I don\u2019t understand what\u2019s so hard about listening to your boss."
  - "My wife? Sometimes she\u2019ll say that she\u2019s unhappy with me, but I think she needs to be more understanding. She just doesn\u2019t get how important this diner is to me. It's hard work to run this place and my time is valuable, I can\u2019t be preoccupied with her feelings all the time."
  - "Oh James? That scoundrel thinks he can come around here and flirt with my wife like he owns the place. That nuthead just won\u2019t learn his lesson. When will he just leave my wife alone?"
  interactionKey: 101
  nextMessageKey: 101
