    - target: {fileID: 8682519443021358668, guid: b3f693e1ecc8f694d944803d102f3038, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionText
      value: to talk to Sophie
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682519443021358668, guid: b3f693e1ecc8f694d944803d102f3038, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionMessage.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682519443021358668, guid: b3f693e1ecc8f694d944803d102f3038, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'interactionMessage.Array.data[0]'
      value: "My husband? He\u2019s become an angry old man. I remember when we were young, he\u2019d talk about his big dreams of opening the perfect diner, about working together and supporting each other\u2019s dreams, but now I look at him and I feel like I can\u2019t recognize him anymore."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682519443021358668, guid: b3f693e1ecc8f694d944803d102f3038, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'interactionMessage.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Working has eaten away at him and he\u2019s become a shell of who he once was. He barely spares me a glance, and when he does, it's always to complain about something. What he promised me has brought me nothing but pain... I wish I could do something about it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
